# team — dev

ABOUT  the development team — a developer implements, a reviewer checks the change

IMPORT  change-summary FROM @main.templates

WHEN asked to implement a change:
    RUN implement-and-review

FLOW implement-and-review:
    STEP implement the change:
        BY developer
        DO implement the requested change and run the tests
    STEP review the change:
        BY reviewer
        CONTEXT summary
        AS change-summary
        DO review the change for bugs and duplicated logic
